                            "November 17, 2026: At SC26, Qualcomm and Cirrascale launched cloud evaluation access for the liquid-cooled Dragonfly AI200 rack-scale inference platform (768 GB LPDDR per card), targeting energy-efficient enterprise AI workloads.",
                            "November 5–18, 2026: Analysts trimmed expectations following Q4 guidance, with Freedom Broker downgrading QCOM to Hold ($185 target on Nov 9), Susquehanna cutting to $165 (Nov 5), and Baird lowering to $300 (Nov 18).",
                            "November 4, 2026: Qualcomm beat Q4 FY26 consensus with $10.44B non-GAAP revenue (-7.3% YoY) and $2.17 EPS (-28.3% YoY), guiding Q1 FY27 revenue to $10.4B–$11.2B with at least $650M from Data Center chips.",
                            "November 4, 2026: SpaceX selected Qualcomm\u0027s Dragonwing 5G RAN platforms for Starlink Mobile\u0027s nationwide U.S. terrestrial network starting in 2027, marking Qualcomm\u0027s largest 5G infrastructure agreement."
